  "Off": "关闭",
  "Off by default. Turn this on to start a video as soon as its details panel opens; the play button still works when it is off.": "默认关闭。开启后，详细信息面板一打开就会开始播放视频；关闭时播放按钮仍可使用。",
  "Off means double-click, like Explorer's default. The checkbox still only selects, so a click on it never opens the entry.": "关闭表示双击，与资源管理器的默认相同。复选框仍然只用于选择，因此点击它永远不会打开项目。",
  "One click changes the accent and the highlight together.": "单击即可同时更改强调色和高亮色。",
