  "Share of this process that the .NET heap holds; thumbnails and folder size walks live here. The runtime grows it on demand and gives it back after a collection.": "此进程中由 .NET 堆持有的比例；缩略图和文件夹大小计算都在此。运行时会按需扩展，并在回收后归还。",
