  "Shown": "显示",
  "Shown in every folder; changing them changes all folders at once.": "在所有文件夹中显示；更改会一次应用于所有文件夹。",
  "Shows the pictures, videos and documents the shell can preview as grid tiles below the list. The tiles follow the grid size, and the panel only appears in list mode.": "在列表下方以网格磁贴显示外壳可预览的图片、视频和文档。磁贴会跟随网格大小，且面板只在列表模式出现。",
  "Size": "大小",
  "Split view": "分屏视图",
  "Status": "状态",
  "Stop opening archives with this app": "停止用此应用打开压缩包",
  "Stop opening yafm:// links": "停止打开 yafm:// 链接",
  "Stop scanning this folder": "停止扫描此文件夹",
  "Stored in the folder's parent {index}, so it stays with the files.": "存储在文件夹上级的 {index}，因此会随文件一起移动。",
  "Suggested apps": "建议的应用",
  "Symbolic link": "符号链接",
  "System": "系统",
  "System default": "系统默认",
  "Tags": "标签",
  "Target": "目标",
  "The administrator view is already loaded": "已加载管理员视图",
  "The default view, list icon size and grid size are only defaults: a folder can still remember its own from the title bar.": "默认视图、列表图标大小和网格大小只是默认值：文件夹仍可从标题栏记住自己的设置。",
  "The files could not be transferred.": "无法传输文件。",
  "The height of a grid tile; the icon inside follows it.": "网格磁贴的高度；其中的图标会随之调整。",
  "The icon in the list rows.": "列表行中的图标。",
  "The language the interface uses. English is the default; the system option follows the operating system.": "界面使用的语言。默认为英文；系统选项会跟随操作系统。",
  "The mode every folder starts with. A folder can still remember its own list or grid mode from the title bar.": "每个文件夹一开始使用的模式。文件夹仍可从标题栏记住自己的列表或网格模式。",
  "The recycle bin is empty.": "回收站是空的。",
  "The runtime, loaded libraries and the Rust helper share this part. Rust runs inside the process, so it has no separate figure.": "运行时、已加载的库和 Rust 辅助程序共用这部分。Rust 在进程内运行，因此没有单独的数字。",
  "This PC": "此电脑",
  "This folder is empty.": "此文件夹为空。",
  "To clipboard": "复制到剪贴板",
  "Tray": "托盘",
  "Trim now": "立即整理",
  "Type": "类型",
  "Unpin from the sidebar": "从侧边栏取消固定",
  "Unregister": "取消注册",
  "Up one level": "上一级",
  "Use custom folder icons": "使用自定义文件夹图标",
  "Use system file icons": "使用系统文件图标",
  "Use {colour}": "使用 {colour}",
  "Version": "版本",
  "Video previews play muted by default. Turn this on to hear their audio while the details panel is open.": "视频预览默认静音播放。开启后，详细信息面板打开时即可听到音频。",
  "View": "视图",
  "Working…": "正在处理…",
  "Write the selected tray entries to the system clipboard": "将选中的托盘内容写入系统剪贴板",
  "built-in: {source}": "内置：{source}",
  "scanning…": "正在扫描…",
  "this item": "此项目",
  "{count} items": "{count} 个项目",
  "{count} items selected": "已选择 {count} 个项目",
  "{count} selected": "已选择 {count} 个",
