  "{count} columns": "{count} 列",
  "1 visit · {path}": "访问 1 次 · {path}",
  "{count} visits · {path}": "访问 {count} 次 · {path}",
  "1 item": "1 个项目",
  "1 item selected": "已选择 1 个项目",
  "1 operation running": "1 项操作正在运行",
  "{count} operations running": "{count} 项操作正在运行",
  "Permanently delete 1 item? This cannot be undone.": "要永久删除 1 个项目吗？此操作无法撤销。",
  "Permanently delete {count} items? This cannot be undone.": "要永久删除 {count} 个项目吗？此操作无法撤销。",
  "Permanently delete 1 selected item? This cannot be undone.": "要永久删除选中的 1 个项目吗？此操作无法撤销。",
  "Permanently delete {count} selected items? This cannot be undone.": "要永久删除选中的 {count} 个项目吗？此操作无法撤销。",
  "Restored {done} of 1 item.": "已还原 1 个项目中的 {done} 个。",
  "Restored {done} of {total} items.": "已还原 {total} 个项目中的 {done} 个。",
  "Deleted {done} of 1 item.": "已删除 1 个项目中的 {done} 个。",
  "Deleted {done} of {total} items.": "已删除 {total} 个项目中的 {done} 个。",
  "Used in 1 folder. Renaming or removing it updates that folder's index.": "用于 1 个文件夹。重命名或移除会更新该文件夹的索引。",
  "Used in {count} folders. Renaming or removing it updates those folders' indexes.": "用于 {count} 个文件夹。重命名或移除会更新这些文件夹的索引。",
  "Add preset": "添加预设",
  "Preset name": "预设名称",
  "Remove preset": "移除预设",
  "Save the current colours as a preset": "将当前颜色保存为预设",
  "Application": "应用",
  "The build, its yafm:// links, and what reopens at launch.": "版本、yafm:// 链接，以及启动时要重新打开的内容。",
  "Colors": "颜色",
  "The accent and highlight colours the whole window uses.": "整个窗口使用的强调色和高亮色。",
  "Every tag the catalogue has seen, ready to rename or remove.": "目录中出现过的每个标签，可重命名或移除。",
  "Files view": "文件视图",
  "Files view (global)": "文件视图 (全局)",
  "The defaults every folder starts with; a folder can still override them.": "每个文件夹的默认值；文件夹仍可覆盖。",
  "Shortcuts": "快捷键",
  "The keys this window listens for. Click a combination to record a new one.": "此窗口监听的按键。单击组合键即可录制新的组合。",
  "Memory": "内存",
  "What the process holds and how to give it back.": "进程占用的资源，以及如何归还。",
  "The home tab's history and how much of it it shows.": "主页标签页的历史记录，以及显示的数量。",
  "The folders the gallery scans for pictures and videos.": "图库扫描图片和视频的文件夹。",
  "Icons": "图标",
  "Where the shell's own icons and the built-in glyphs come from.": "外壳图标和内置图标的来源。",
  "Icons by extension": "按扩展名的图标",
  "A custom glyph for one file extension.": "为单一扩展名指定自定义图标。",
  "Folder icons": "文件夹图标",
  "A single folder can carry an icon of its own.": "单个文件夹可以拥有专属图标。",
  "Folder index": "文件夹索引",
  "The hidden cache that makes a folder open instantly next time.": "让文件夹下次能瞬间打开的隐藏缓存。",
  "What the listings include.": "列表包含的内容。",
  "Home folder": "主文件夹",
  "Edit location": "编辑位置",
  "Next tab": "下一个标签页",
  "Previous tab": "上一个标签页",
  "Undo": "撤销",
  "Redo": "重做",
  "Invert selection": "反向选择",
  "Icons view": "图标视图",
  "Details view": "详细信息视图",
  "Open terminal": "打开终端",
  "Show hidden files": "显示隐藏文件",
  "Open in a new tab": "在新标签页中打开",
  "Back to the default combination for every action.": "恢复每个操作的默认组合。",
  "The previous folder in this tab. The mouse back button and the browser back key always work.": "此标签页中的上一个文件夹。鼠标后退键和浏览器后退键始终有效。",
  "The next folder in this tab. The mouse forward button and the browser forward key always work.": "此标签页中的下一个文件夹。鼠标前进键和浏览器前进键始终有效。",
  "Opens the folder that contains the current one.": "打开包含当前文件夹的上一级文件夹。",
  "Jumps to the user's home folder, like Alt+Home in Dolphin.": "跳到用户的主文件夹，就像 Dolphin 的 Alt+Home。",
  "Opens the floating search box. Typing a letter in a folder opens it too.": "打开浮动搜索框。在文件夹中输入字母也会打开。",
  "Turns the breadcrumbs into an editable path; Ctrl+L in Dolphin.": "将面包屑变成可编辑的路径；Dolphin 为 Ctrl+L。",
  "Closes the tab that is open.": "关闭当前打开的标签页。",
  "Opens the overview in a new tab.": "在新标签页中打开概览。",
  "Cycles to the next tab.": "循环切换到下一个标签页。",
  "Cycles to the previous tab.": "循环切换到上一个标签页。",
  "Ctrl+D copies too, following KDE's file manager.": "Ctrl+D 也可复制，遵循 KDE 文件管理器的习惯。",
  "Moves the selection on the next paste.": "下次粘贴时移动所选内容。",
  "Copies or moves the clipboard's files into the current folder.": "将剪贴板中的文件复制或移动到当前文件夹。",
  "Undoes the last file operation in this session.": "撤销此会话中最后的文件操作。",
  "Repeats the operation that was just undone.": "重复刚刚撤销的操作。",
  "Delete is Del by default, not Ctrl+D.": "删除默认为 Del，而不是 Ctrl+D。",
  "Bypasses the recycle bin; Dolphin uses Shift+Delete.": "绕过回收站；Dolphin 使用 Shift+Delete。",
  "Renames the single selected entry.": "重命名单个选中的项目。",
  "Selects every entry in the current folder.": "选择当前文件夹中的所有项目。",
  "Selects everything that is not selected; Dolphin uses Ctrl+Shift+A.": "选择所有未选中的项目；Dolphin 使用 Ctrl+Shift+A。",
  "Opens the selected folder or file.": "打开选中的文件夹或文件。",
  "Creates a folder in the current directory. F10 also works.": "在当前目录中创建文件夹。F10 也可使用。",
  "Opens the shell properties sheet.": "打开外壳属性表。",
  "Reads the current folder again.": "重新读取当前文件夹。",
  "Switches the folder to the grid view.": "将文件夹切换为网格视图。",
  "Switches the folder to the list view.": "将文件夹切换为列表视图。",
  "Opens Windows Terminal in the current folder; Dolphin uses F4 for its terminal panel.": "在当前文件夹中打开 Windows Terminal；Dolphin 使用 F4 打开终端面板。",
  "Toggles ordinary hidden files for this session. Alt+. also works; system files still follow Explorer.": "切换此会话中的普通隐藏文件。Alt+. 也可使用；系统文件仍遵循资源管理器。",
  "Shows the next file tab beside the current one; F3 in Dolphin.": "在当前标签页旁显示下一个文件标签页；Dolphin 为 F3。",
  "Hold this while clicking a folder.": "按住此键并单击文件夹。",
