  "Version {version}": "版本 {version}",
  "Update available": "有可用更新",
  "Add a tag here; it is available in every folder.": "在这里添加标签，所有文件夹都能使用。",
  "Could not add the tag.": "无法添加标签。",
  "Could not change the tag's color.": "无法更改标签颜色。",
  "No tags yet. Add one below; it is available in every folder.": "还没有标签。在下方添加一个，所有文件夹都能使用。",
  "Every tag in the catalogue; add, rename, recolour or remove them here.": "目录中的每个标签；可在此添加、重命名、改色或移除。",
  "Reopen closed tab": "重新打开关闭的标签页",
  "Brings back the tab you closed last, folder and all.": "把最后关闭的标签页连同文件夹一起恢复。",
  "Could not delete the selection.": "外壳无法删除所选内容。",
  "Could not move the selection to the recycle bin.": "外壳无法将所选内容移到回收站。",
  "Registers this app for folder opens on this account. Explorer stays available from the context menu; on Linux this sets the inode/directory default.": "将此程序注册为此账户打开文件夹的处理程序。Explorer 仍保留在右键菜单中；Linux 会设置 inode/directory 的默认关联。",
  "Stop using this app for folders": "停止使用此程序打开文件夹",
  "Use as the default file manager": "设为默认文件管理器",
