  "Batch file": "批处理文件",
  "PowerShell file": "PowerShell 文件",
  "CSV file": "CSV 文件",
  "XML file": "XML 文件",
  "YAML file": "YAML 文件",
  "Could not create the item.": "无法创建项目。",
  "History": "历史记录",
  "Background": "背景",
  "Wallpaper": "壁纸",
  "A picture or video behind the whole window, from the title bar to the bottom.": "整个窗口（从标题栏到底部）背后的图片或视频。",
  "None keeps the normal dark surface. Built-in concepts are scalable SVGs; a custom picture or video is loaded from its file.": "“无”保留原本的深色表面。内置概念背景是可缩放的 SVG；自定义图片或视频会从文件加载。",
  "Image…": "图片…",
  "Video…": "视频…",
  "Blur": "模糊",
  "Saturation": "饱和度",
  "Brightness": "亮度",
  "Aurora": "极光",
  "Dunes": "沙丘",
  "Tide": "潮汐",
  "Motion": "动态",
  "Custom": "自定义",
  "Drift": "漂流",
  "Ember": "余烬",
  "Bloom": "绽放",
  "None keeps the normal dark surface. Every built-in concept comes in the app's colour presets; your own pictures, SVGs and videos are kept in the gallery.": "“无”保留原本的深色表面。每个内置概念都有软件全部配色变体；自定义图片、SVG 和视频会保存在下方图库中。",
  "Safety": "安全",
  "Protected folders": "受保护文件夹",
  "A path ending in ** covers every subfolder. A plain path protects only that folder, but deleting its parent is still held back. Environment variables such as %USERPROFILE% are expanded before the check.": "结尾为 ** 的路径会涵盖所有子文件夹；普通路径只保护该文件夹本身，但删除它的上级文件夹仍会被拦下。检查前会先展开 %USERPROFILE% 这类环境变量。",
  "Includes subfolders": "包含子文件夹",
  "This folder only": "仅此文件夹",
  "Add folder…": "添加文件夹…",
  "Confirmation delay": "确认延迟",
  "The delete button in the protected-folder dialog stays disabled for this many seconds. At least 1.": "受保护文件夹对话框的删除按钮会停用这么多秒，至少 1 秒。",
  "Protected folder": "受保护文件夹",
  "These paths are protected by the safety settings:": "以下路径受到安全设置保护：",
  "Protected by {pattern}": "受到 {pattern} 保护",
  "Deletes permanently": "永久删除",
  "Moves to the recycle bin": "移到回收站",
  "Nothing has been deleted.": "尚未删除任何内容。",
  "This waits {seconds}s before the delete button works.": "需等待 {seconds} 秒后删除按钮才能使用。",
  "Delete anyway ({seconds}s)": "仍要删除（{seconds} 秒）",
  "Delete anyway": "仍要删除",
  "Deleting a protected folder, anything inside a recursive entry, or a folder that contains one always waits for an explicit confirmation.": "删除受保护文件夹、递归项内的任何内容，或包含受保护项的上级文件夹，一律需要明确确认。",
  "Rules are glob-like: ** covers the folder and everything below it, * covers the folder and the entries directly inside it, and a plain path covers only the folder. Environment variables such as %USERPROFILE% are expanded first.": "规则是类似 glob 的路径：** 涵盖文件夹本身及其下所有内容，* 涵盖文件夹本身与直接位于其中的项目，普通路径只涵盖文件夹本身。检查前会先展开 %USERPROFILE% 这类环境变量。",
  "Protected path": "保护路径",
  "The delete button in the protected-folder dialog stays disabled for this many seconds. At least 2.": "受保护文件夹对话框的删除按钮会停用这么多秒，至少 2 秒。",
  "Rules are full-path globs: * stays inside one name, ** crosses folders, and ? matches one character. A rule without a folder part, such as *.log, applies to that name at any depth. %VARS%, $VARS and ~ are expanded first.": "规则是完整路径的 glob：* 只匹配同一层名称内的内容，** 可跨文件夹，? 匹配单个字符。没有文件夹部分的规则（例如 *.log）会应用到任意深度的同名文件。检查前会先展开 %VAR%、$VAR 和 ~。",
  "Restore defaults": "恢复默认值",
  "Time format": "时间格式",
  "Format": "格式",
  "24-hour": "24 小时制",
  "12-hour": "12 小时制",
  "Pattern": "模式",
  "Follow the system, force 24-hour or 12-hour time, or define your own pattern.": "跟随系统，或强制使用 24/12 小时制，也可以自定义模式。",
  "Every timestamp in the interface uses this format: follow the system, force 24-hour or 12-hour time, or define your own pattern.": "界面中的所有时间都会使用此格式：可跟随系统、强制 24 或 12 小时制，或自定义模式。",
  "Tokens: yyyy year, MM month, dd day, HH 24-hour, mm minute, ss second, hh 12-hour and a AM/PM. Other characters are copied.": "符号：yyyy 年、MM 月、dd 日、HH 24 小时、mm 分、ss 秒、hh 12 小时、a 上午/下午；其他字符会原样保留。",
  "No matching items.": "没有匹配的项目。",
  "Fonts": "字体",
  "Interface": "界面",
  "Titles": "标题",
  "File names": "文件名",
  "Details panel": "详细信息面板",
  "Address bar": "地址栏",
  "Monospace": "等宽字体",
  "Text preview": "文本预览",
  "Falls back to {font} until another family is chosen.": "在选择其他字体前使用 {font}。",
  "Filter fonts…": "筛选字体…",
  "(default)": "（默认）",
  "No matching font.": "没有匹配的字体。",
  "Back to the app's built-in font for every role.": "让每个用途都恢复为应用内置字体。",
  "Share": "共享",
  "Share folders": "共享文件夹",
