  "Random asks the operating system for one free port when the first web share starts, and every web share keeps using it. Custom always tries the port below.": "随机会在第一次共享 web 目录时向操作系统获取一个空闲端口，之后所有 web 共享共用它；自定义则固定使用下方端口。",
  "Random": "随机",
