  "Startup": "启动",
  "How the app joins your login session, and whether it opens quietly in the tray.": "应用如何加入你的登录会话，以及是否在托盘中安静启动。",
  "Start with the computer": "开机时启动",
  "A shortcut uses the Startup folder (or XDG autostart). A task uses Task Scheduler (or a systemd user service), which starts earlier and is usually faster.": "快捷方式使用“启动”文件夹（或 XDG 自启动）；计划任务使用任务计划程序（或 systemd 用户服务），启动更早，通常也更快。",
